                             JURISDICTION

   The judgments of the court of appeals (Pet. App. C-1;  App., infra,
1a-2a) were entered on December 23, 1981.  Timely petitions for
rehearing were denied on February 5, 1982 (Pet. App. C-3 to C-4).
Justice White extended the time for filing a petition for a writ of
